      "original_text": "The core at Ops-time is a transformation pipeline that processes the monitoring data with the goal of updating a PCM instance (similar to iObserve 9 ). In order to realize the transformation pipeline we used a tee and join pipeline architecture 6 , based on parts of iObserve 9 and the CIPM approach 25 . Fig. 4 shows the structure of the entire transformation pipeline."
