    {
      "text": "There is a need to address how to incorporate CPS, DD, and DTO technologies into existing organizations, benefit from DTO in products and production, define long-term DTO adoption strategies, access and analyze real-time data for decision support, and evolve DTOs systematically with organizational changes.",
      "original_text": "Some decisions, among others, are: (1) How to incorporate CPS, DD and DTO technologies into an existing organization? (2) How to benefit from incorporating DTO in products and/or production? (3) How to define and achieve a long-term strategy for adopting DTO? (4) How to access and analyze data in real-time and enact changes based on decision support mechanisms? (5) When the organization executes structural changes, how to systematically evolve the DTO to reflect these changes?"
