      "original_text": "different patterns have disparate impacts and present different tradeoffs in QoS (e.g., performance, availability, energy consumption), depending on the operational context of the system at run time. This calls for self-adaptive techniques that can autonomously switch between patterns at run time, depending on the specific condi- tions of the execution context, to ensure that the system does not deviate from acceptable QoS levels."
