      "original_text": "To overcome this limitation, we propose an approach for proactive self-adaptation which combines ML and formal quantitative verification (probabilistic model checking). In our approach, ML is tasked with selecting the best adap- tation pattern for a given scenario, and quantitative verification checks the feasibility of the adaptation decision, preventing the execution of unfeasible adaptations and providing feedback to the ML engine which helps to achieve faster convergence towards optimal decisions."
