      "original_text": "The adoption of Security Orchestration, Automation and Response (SOAR) platforms has recently gained major popularity among security analysts, Security Operation Centers (SOC) and incident response team [1,2,3,4]. SOAR platforms enable integration, orchestration and automation of the activities (e.g., block IP, scan endpoint and isolate host) performed by security tools and human experts [2]."
