      "text": "How to automate the maintenance of smart mesh IoT networks to ensure the required quality goals in the face of uncertain operating conditions?",
      "original_text": "The general challenge we aim to tackle in this joint R \\& D effort is the following:\n\nHow to automate the maintenance of smart mess IoT networks to ensure the required quality goals in the face of uncertain operating conditions?"
