      "text": "Ensuring the safety of software systems during their operational stage by detecting and resolving uncertainties and unknowns caused by interactions with users and the environment.",
      "original_text": "However, the safe behaviour of a software system under certain circumstances cannot be completely ascertained at design/development time without deploying it in a real environment. It is fairly well known that it is necessary to deal with the assurance process of software systems also during the operational stage, when all relevant uncertainties and unknowns caused by the close interactions of the system with their users and the environment can be detected and resolved [10, 21, 28]."
