re two main drawbacks to this approach. Firstly, the solution does not provide full guarantees. As soon as a component is trusted, it can start generating fake data. The second drawback is that it requires a manual step before contributors can get rewarded, namely getting authorized by the whitelist. Ideally, the platform would provide a built-in mechanism to overcome this issue in an automated way, but this remains an open issue."
